{
    "title": "KZ01 - Digital Watch face",
    "description": "The KZ01 digital watch is the perfect companion for the modern, on-the-go individual. Its sleek and intuitive design provides a clear overview of all the information you need at a glance, including the time (displayed in either 12 or 24 hour format), date, and day. Keep track of your battery life, step count, and heart rate, all while setting and achieving your daily step goal of 10,000 steps. With easy access to four of your favorite apps and a customisable complication feature, you can tailor the watch to your unique needs, whether that be checking the weather or tracking your daily activity. Upgrade your wrist game and make the KZ01 your go-to watch for all your timekeeping and lifestyle needs.\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n- Time display in 12 or 24 hour format\r\n- Optimized for battery life.\r\n- Date and day display\r\n- Battery life monitoring\r\n- Step counter with daily step goal of 10,000\r\n- Heart rate monitoring\r\n- 4 shortcuts to favorite apps\r\n- Customizable complication (e.g. weather)\r\n- 28 different color options\r\n- Different background patterns",
    "descriptionHTML": "The KZ01 digital watch is the perfect companion for the modern, on-the-go individual. Its sleek and intuitive design provides a clear overview of all the information you need at a glance, including the time (displayed in either 12 or 24 hour format), date, and day. Keep track of your battery life, step count, and heart rate, all while setting and achieving your daily step goal of 10,000 steps. With easy access to four of your favorite apps and a customisable complication feature, you can tailor the watch to your unique needs, whether that be checking the weather or tracking your daily activity. Upgrade your wrist game and make the KZ01 your go-to watch for all your timekeeping and lifestyle needs.<br><br>Features:<br><br>- Time display in 12 or 24 hour format<br>- Optimized for battery life.<br>- Date and day display<br>- Battery life monitoring<br>- Step counter with daily step goal of 10,000<br>- Heart rate monitoring<br>- 4 shortcuts to favorite apps<br>- Customizable complication (e.g. weather)<br>- 28 different color options<br>- Different background patterns",
